/**
 * HEX COLOR → THEME TOKEN MAPPING
 * Maps every unique hex color found in the Figma screens to its
 * corresponding theme.ts token.
 * 
 * Generated by scanning all 33 JSON files + figma_execute plugin extraction.
 * Frequency: how many times this hex appears across all screens.
 * 
 * For colors NOT in theme.ts, maps to the closest theme token.
 */

